  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3102.25 Permanent",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3102.25 \"Permanent\" means \"permanent\" as defined in RSA 125-J:1,XXI, namely \"that the emissions reductions implemented for the generation and certification of an ERC must be assured for the life of the corresponding increase through a federally enforceable document.\"\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
